oreground py-6" href="/life-at-fashion-asia">Life at Fashion Asia<span class="absolute bottom-4 left-0 h-[1px] w-0 bg-primary transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full"></span></a><a class="whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-2.5 font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-secondary hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(14,201,122,0.4)]" href="/contact">Connect</a></nav><button class="relative z-[1001] flex h-6 w-8 flex-col items-end justify-between xl:hidden" aria-label="Toggle Menu"><span class="h-[2px] bg-foreground transition-all duration-300 w-8"></span><span class="h-[2px] bg-foreground transition-all duration-300 w-6"></span><span class="h-[2px] bg-foreground transition-all duration-300 w-8"></span></button></div></header><main class="flex-grow flex flex-col"><div class="flex flex-col bg-background"><section class="relative flex min-h-[50vh] flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-black pt-32 pb-16 text-center"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,#016138_0%,transparent_40%)] opacity-10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="container relative z-10 flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary">Inheriting Excellence</span></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><h1 class="mt-6 font-serif text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem)] font-bold leading-tight text-foreground">Who We Are</h1></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><p class="mt-8 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70 max-w-2xl">A 100% export-oriented Ready-Made Garments manufacturing company specializing in knitwear, backed by the legacy of Northern Tosrifa Group.</p></div></div></section><section class="container py-24 md:py-32"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] lg:gap-20"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-gradient md:text-4xl mb-8">About Us</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed text-lg"><strong class="font-semibold text-white">Fashion Asia Ltd.</strong> is a modern and responsible knitwear manufacturer based in Sreepur, Gazipur, Bangladesh. As a sister concern of <strong class="font-semibold text-white">Northern Tosrifa Group (NTG)</strong>, with over 34 years of apparel industry experience, we focus on quality, innovation, and responsible manufacturing.</p><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed text-lg">With <strong class="font-semibold text-white">26 production lines and a monthly capacity of 800,000 pieces</strong>, we serve global customers with a wide range of knit garments. Our <strong class="font-semibold text-white">Green Building</strong> factory, supported by solar power, rainwater harvesting, advanced technology, and 2,000 skilled employees, reflects our strong commitment to <strong class="font-semibold text-white">sustainability, quality, and compliance</strong>.</p></div></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="relative mx-auto aspect-[2/3] w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10"><img src="/images/client/who-we-are.jpg" alt="Fashion Asia Limited knitwear" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"/><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 rounded-full border border-primary/60 bg-background/80 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary backdrop-blur-md">Knitwear Craftsmanship</div></div></div></div></section><section class="container pb-24 md:pb-32"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">The Numbers</span><h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl">What Partners Can Count On</h2></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-black p-6 md:p-8"><span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gradient md:text-4xl">99.2%</span><span class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 md:text-xs">Right First Time</span></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-black p-6 md:p-8"><span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gradient md:text-4xl">98.5%</span><span class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 md:text-xs">On-Time Delivery</span></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-black p-6 md:p-8"><span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gradient md:text-4xl">800K</span><span class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 md:text-xs">Pieces / Month</span></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-black p-6 md:p-8"><span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gradient md:text-4xl">$30M</span><span class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 md:text-xs">Annual Turnover</span></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-surface py-24 border-y border-white/5"><div class="container grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 md:grid-cols-2 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 h-full hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Our Vision</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-foreground">The Company We Intend to Be</h3><p class="mt-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-lg">We are committed to becoming the most trusted and preferred organization for our customers, employees, suppliers, shareholders, and the communities we serve.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-black/50 h-full hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Our Mission</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-foreground">How We Get There</h3><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-lg"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_10px_#016138]"></span>Excellence in quality, innovation, and on-time delivery.</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-lg"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_10px_#016138]"></span>A safe workplace built on dignity, respect, and human rights.</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white/60 leading-relaxed text-lg"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_10px_#016138]"></span>Sustainable and ethical business for a better future.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="container py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-white/5"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-16"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Our Journey</span><h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl">Milestones &amp; Achievements</h2><p class="mt-4 text-white/70 text-lg">From the founding of the group in 1967 to a LEED-certified green facility serving buyers worldwide.</p></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div class="absolute left-[7p