">We are committed to delivering products that consistently meet the highest standards of quality and customer expectations.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="h-full rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-colors hover:border-primary/30"><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3">Reliability &amp; Accountability</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">We honor our commitments through on-time delivery, transparency, and dependable service.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="h-full rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-colors hover:border-primary/30"><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3">Respect for People</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">We uphold human rights and foster a safe, inclusive, and empowering workplace for all.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="h-full rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-colors hover:border-primary/30"><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3">Innovation &amp; Continuous Improvement</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">We embrace technology, creativity, and learning to enhance efficiency, quality, and value.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="h-full rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-colors hover:border-primary/30"><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3">Sustainability &amp; Integrity</h3><p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed">We conduct business ethically and responsibly, protecting the environment and contributing to a sustainable future.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="container py-24 md:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><h